# Stackup rules for Devin (node)

Project scope. These rules travel with the repository under `.devin/rules/`.

## Detected stacks

| Ecosystem | Confidence | Signals | Version | Package manager |
|-----------|------------|---------|---------|-----------------|
| node | high | package.json, package-lock.json | >=20 | npm |

## Scope notes

- `.devin/mcp_config.json` configures MCP for Devin CLI runs (project scope).
- The `.windsurf/rules/` fallback mirrors these rules for Windsurf.
